            "review_text": "Stewart\nFort Saskatchewan, Canada232 contributions\n0\nBest Goat in Ho Chi Minh\nDec 2017 • Family\nSupper for 7 serving some seven dishes. The bill was about $50cdn. The curry goat was fantastic along with rice, veggies etc etc. One friend had never tried goat and was amazed with the flavour. Certainly a busy spot but well worth any wait although located off the main street Service was fast and all dishes were hot\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 17, 2017",
