            "review_text": "suraj g\n5 contributions\n0\nFraud/Unethical\nApr 2016\nSells beef in the name of goat. I've eaten goat meat all my life. I know the difference. And please don't tell me that this is some special Vietnamese goat. The meat is 100% Beef. This guy is making a fool of innocent Vietnamese people who cannot tell the difference. And he's using the name of India. He cannot be an Indian. He's either Malaysian or Pakistani. In India he would go to Prison for selling beef in the name of goat. Disgusting place...\nRead more\nWritten April 7, 2016",
