            "review_title": "Review at Musa Curry India",
            "review_text": "Chatham L\n75 contributions\n0\nall the way in a small alleyway\nApr 2015 • Friends\ngood goat curry.\nit is tuck away in a small alleyway. table was clean when I arrived. \nfood - goat curry with bread. you can have it with noddles as well. the curry was so so nice, i don't know how to describe it. ok at first the look of the curry is not so pleasing, but when you eat it, wow! the favours go crazy in my mouth. i wish they had chicken or beef curry as well.\n\nservice - staff were helpful and friendly\n\ncost a bit expensive for a large I remember it cost me around 10,000 đồng. \n\nreturn. yes i will.\nRead more\nWritten April 3, 2015",
