            "review_text": "René B\nAmsterdam, The Netherlands1 contribution\n0\nBest curry in HCMC\nJan 2015 • Friends\nHidden away from sight in the back alleys across from the Windsor hotel, this place serves up the best curry in HCMC. \nThe place is alive and buzzing with energy, mostly locals who come here to eat, drink and nice evening out. \nThe staff is excellent and the food came within minutes of ordering. Don't expect them to understand a lot of English though, so be prepared to point and gesture unless you of course you speak Vietnamese.\nRead more\nWritten January 25, 2015",
